<h2>Hello {{candidate_name}},</h2>

<p>Your stipend payment for <strong>{{month}}</strong> has been processed!</p>

<div class="info-box">
  <p><strong>Month:</strong> {{month}}</p>
  <p><strong>Amount Processed:</strong> ₹{{amount}}</p>
  <p><strong>Payment Status:</strong> <span class="badge badge-success">{{status}}</span></p>
  {{#if transaction_id}}
  <p><strong>Transaction Ref:</strong> {{transaction_id}}</p>
  {{/if}}
</div>

<p>You can view full transaction breakdown and download payment receipts in your 'Stipend & Payments' dashboard.</p>

<p>Best regards,<br><strong>The Even Cargo Team</strong></p>
